{"id":"n66519-1-7","stage":3,"title":"쑥스럽다 · 害羞","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66519-1-7-1","ko":"민준아! 어제 저녁 모임 때 왜 안 왔니?","zh":"敏俊啊！昨天晚上的聚会你怎么没来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아!","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모임","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔니?","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ae81cbdead4267e6a51.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66519-1-7-2","ko":"여자들 많은 곳에 가기가 좀 쑥스러워서.","zh":"因为去女生多的地方让我有点不好意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여자들","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가기가","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쑥스러워서.","meaning":"害羞，不好意思","explanation":"쑥스럽다：害羞，不好意思；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쑥스럽다","audio":"/audio/e677b890de44032413f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66519","senseId":"1","lemma":"쑥스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e677b890de440324","term":"쑥스럽다","zh":"害羞，不好意思","audio":"/audio/e677b890de44032413f9.mp3","entryId":"66519","definition":"行动或样子不自然或不恰当而羞涩。","pronunciation":["쑥쓰럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/872abc3ac6b56c909aeb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.872,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66519","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","licen